    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Single-page conditional job entry\n\nUse the production URL from **Open Job Entry Form** after activating the workflow.\n\n- Entry Type defaults to External.\n- Switching Entry Type updates the visible fields immediately on the same page.\n- LinkedIn mode shows only LinkedIn Job URL, which is required.\n- External mode shows Job URL, Company Name, Job Title, Job Description, Location, Contract Type, Published Date, and External Job ID.\n- External required fields are Job URL, Company Name, Job Title, and Job Description. The remaining External fields are optional.\n- LinkedIn submissions use the native Apify node with actor ID `2rJKkhh7vjpX7pvjg` and the existing Apify credential.\n- Both webhook entry branches are fully connected: GET serves the form and POST validates and processes the submission.\n- Clicking Execute Workflow puts webhook triggers into test-listening mode. Open the test URL shown by **Open Job Entry Form** to use the form during testing.\n\nThe downstream CV, cover-letter, upload, Baserow, credential, mapping, and sub-workflow nodes are preserved.\n",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 1700
      },
